<title>SOUTH KOREA: S. Korean retail petrol prices edge lower - table.</title>
<headline>S. Korean retail petrol prices edge lower - table.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrol prices at South Korean pumps edged lower on average for June sales, refiners figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Only LG-Caltex Oil Corp raised prices among the five refiners.</p>
<p>(price relate to average forecourt prices, in Korean won per litre)</p>
<p>			    June  Previous</p>
<p>Yukong		    829   832</p>
<p>LG-Caltex		 829   825</p>
<p>Ssangyong		 826   828</p>
<p>Hanwha		    826   827</p>
<p>Hyundai		   826   828</p>
<p>AVERAGE		   827   828</p>
<p>($1 = 892 won)</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
